{"n":59,"name":"Al-Hashr","nameAr":"الحشر","meaning":"The Exile","ayahs":24,"place":"madinah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":28,"ar":"سَبَّحَ لِلَّهِ مَا فِى ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ وَمَا فِى ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ وَهُوَ ٱلْعَزِيزُ ٱلْحَكِيمُ","en":"Whatever is in the heavens and whatever is on the earth exalts Allāh, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[{"ar":"سَبَّحَ","tr":"sabbaḥa","en":"Glorifies","root":"سبح","lem":"سَبَّحَ"},{"ar":"لِلَّهِ","tr":"lillahi","en":"[to] Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلسَّمَـٰوَٰتِ","tr":"l-samāwāti","en":"the heavens","root":"سمو","lem":"سَماء"},{"ar":"وَمَا","tr":"wamā","en":"and whatever"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"(is) in"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضِ ۖ","tr":"l-arḍi","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَهُوَ","tr":"wahuwa","en":"And He"},{"ar":"ٱلْعَزِيزُ","tr":"l-ʿazīzu","en":"(is) the All-Mighty","root":"عزز","lem":"عَزِيز"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَكِيمُ","tr":"l-ḥakīmu","en":"the All-Wise","root":"حكم","lem":"حَكِيم"}]},{"n":2,"juz":28,"ar":"هُوَ ٱلَّذِىٓ أَخْرَجَ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ مِن دِيَـٰرِهِمْ لِأَوَّلِ ٱلْحَشْرِ ۚ مَا ظَنَنتُمْ أَن يَخْرُجُوا۟ ۖ وَظَنُّوٓا۟ أَنَّهُم مَّانِعَتُهُمْ حُصُونُهُم مِّنَ ٱللَّهِ فَأَتَىٰهُمُ ٱللَّهُ مِنْ حَيْثُ لَمْ يَحْتَسِبُوا۟ ۖ وَقَذَفَ فِى قُلُوبِهِمُ ٱلرُّعْبَ ۚ يُخْرِبُونَ بُيُوتَهُم بِأَيْدِيهِمْ وَأَيْدِى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ فَٱعْتَبِرُوا۟ يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","en":"It is He who expelled the ones who disbelieved among the People of the Scripture from their homes at the first gathering. You did not think they would leave, and they thought that their fortresses would protect them from Allāh; but [the decree of] Allāh came upon them from where they had not expected, and He cast terror into their hearts [so] they destroyed their houses by their [own] hands and the hands of the believers. So take warning, O people of vision.","w":[{"ar":"هُوَ","tr":"huwa","en":"He"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِىٓ","tr":"alladhī","en":"(is) the One Who"},{"ar":"أَخْرَجَ","tr":"akhraja","en":"expelled","root":"خرج","lem":"أَخْرَجَ"},{"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","tr":"alladhīna","en":"those who"},{"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","tr":"kafarū","en":"disbelieved","root":"كفر","lem":"كَفَرَ"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"أَهْلِ","tr":"ahli","en":"(the) People","root":"أهل","lem":"أَهْل"},{"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبِ","tr":"l-kitābi","en":"(of) the Scripture","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"مِن","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"دِيَـٰرِهِمْ","tr":"diyārihim","en":"their homes","root":"دور","lem":"دار"},{"ar":"لِأَوَّلِ","tr":"li-awwali","en":"at (the) first","root":"أول","lem":"أَوَّل"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَشْرِ ۚ","tr":"l-ḥashri","en":"gathering","root":"حشر","lem":"حَشْر"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Not"},{"ar":"ظَنَنتُمْ","tr":"ẓanantum","en":"you think","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"that"},{"ar":"يَخْرُجُوا۟ ۖ","tr":"yakhrujū","en":"they would leave","root":"خرج","lem":"خَرَجَ"},{"ar":"وَظَنُّوٓا۟","tr":"waẓannū","en":"and they thought","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَنَّهُم","tr":"annahum","en":"that [they]"},{"ar":"مَّانِعَتُهُمْ","tr":"māniʿatuhum","en":"would defend them","root":"منع","lem":"مانِعَت"},{"ar":"حُصُونُهُم","tr":"ḥuṣūnuhum","en":"their fortresses","root":"حصن","lem":"حُصُون"},{"ar":"مِّنَ","tr":"mina","en":"against"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"فَأَتَىٰهُمُ","tr":"fa-atāhumu","en":"But came to them","root":"أتي","lem":"أَتَى"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"حَيْثُ","tr":"ḥaythu","en":"where","root":"حيث","lem":"حَيْث"},{"ar":"لَمْ","tr":"lam","en":"not"},{"ar":"يَحْتَسِبُوا۟ ۖ","tr":"yaḥtasibū","en":"they expected","root":"حسب","lem":"يَحْتَسِبُ"},{"ar":"وَقَذَفَ","tr":"waqadhafa","en":"and He cast","root":"قذف","lem":"قَذَفَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"into"},{"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمُ","tr":"qulūbihimu","en":"their hearts","root":"قلب","lem":"قَلْب"},{"ar":"ٱلرُّعْبَ ۚ","tr":"l-ruʿ'ba","en":"[the] terror","root":"رعب","lem":"رُعْب"},{"ar":"يُخْرِبُونَ","tr":"yukh'ribūna","en":"they destroyed","root":"خرب","lem":"يُخْرِبُ"},{"ar":"بُيُوتَهُم","tr":"buyūtahum","en":"their houses","root":"بيت","lem":"بَيْت"},{"ar":"بِأَيْدِيهِمْ","tr":"bi-aydīhim","en":"with their hands","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"وَأَيْدِى","tr":"wa-aydī","en":"and the hands","root":"يدي","lem":"يَد"},{"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","tr":"l-mu'minīna","en":"(of) the believers","root":"أمن","lem":"مُؤْمِن"},{"ar":"فَٱعْتَبِرُوا۟","tr":"fa-iʿ'tabirū","en":"So take a lesson","root":"عبر","lem":"اعْتَبِرُ"},{"ar":"يَـٰٓأُو۟لِى","tr":"yāulī","en":"O those endowed"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَبْصَـٰرِ","tr":"l-abṣāri","en":"(with) insight","root":"بصر","lem":"بَصَر"}]},{"n":3,"juz":28,"ar":"وَلَوْلَآ أَن كَتَبَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَيْهِمُ ٱلْجَلَآءَ لَعَذَّبَهُمْ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ وَلَهُمْ فِى ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ عَذَابُ ٱلنَّارِ","en":"And if not that Allāh had decreed for them evacuation, He would have punished them in [this] world, and for them in the Hereafter is the punishment of the Fire.","w":[{"ar":"وَلَوْلَآ","tr":"walawlā","en":"And if not"},{"ar":"أَن","tr":"an","en":"[that]"},{"ar":"كَتَبَ","tr":"kataba","en":"(had) decreed","root":"كتب","lem":"كَتَبَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمُ","tr":"ʿalayhimu","en":"for them"},{"ar":"ٱلْجَلَآءَ","tr":"l-jalāa","en":"the exile","root":"جلو","lem":"جَلاء"},{"ar":"لَعَذَّبَهُمْ","tr":"laʿadhabahum","en":"certainly He (would) have punished them","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا ۖ","tr":"l-dun'yā","en":"the world","root":"دنو","lem":"دُنْيا"},{"ar":"وَلَهُمْ","tr":"walahum","en":"and for them"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ","tr":"l-ākhirati","en":"the Hereafter","root":"أخر","lem":"آخِر"},{"ar":"عَذَابُ","tr":"ʿadhābu","en":"(is) a punishment","root":"عذب","lem":"عَذاب"},{"ar":"ٱلنَّارِ","tr":"l-nāri","en":"(of) the Fire","root":"نور","lem":"نار"}]},{"n":4,"juz":28,"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ بِأَنَّهُمْ شَآقُّوا۟ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ ۖ وَمَن يُشَآقِّ ٱللَّهَ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ شَدِيدُ ٱلْعِقَابِ","en":"That is because they opposed Allāh and His Messenger. And whoever opposes Allāh - then indeed, Allāh is severe in penalty.","w":[{"ar":"ذَٰلِكَ","tr":"dhālika","en":"That"},{"ar":"بِأَنَّهُمْ","tr":"bi-annahum","en":"(is) because [they]"},{"ar":"شَآقُّوا۟","tr":"shāqqū","en":"they opposed","root":"شقق","lem":"شاقُّ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ ۖ","tr":"warasūlahu","en":"and His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"وَمَن","tr":"waman","en":"And whoever"},{"ar":"يُشَآقِّ","tr":"yushāqqi","en":"opposes","root":"شقق","lem":"شاقُّ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"فَإِنَّ","tr":"fa-inna","en":"then indeed"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"شَدِيدُ","tr":"shadīdu","en":"(is) severe","root":"شدد","lem":"شَدِيد"},{"ar":"ٱلْعِقَابِ","tr":"l-ʿiqābi","en":"(in) penalty","root":"عقب","lem":"عِقاب"}]},{"n":5,"juz":28,"ar":"مَا قَطَعْتُم مِّن لِّينَةٍ أَوْ تَرَكْتُمُوهَا قَآئِمَةً عَلَىٰٓ أُصُولِهَا فَبِإِذْنِ ٱللَّهِ وَلِيُخْزِىَ ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","en":"Whatever you have cut down of [their] palm trees or left standing on their trunks - it was by permission of Allāh and so He would disgrace the defiantly disobedient.","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"Whatever"},{"ar":"قَطَعْتُم","tr":"qaṭaʿtum","en":"you cut down","root":"قطع","lem":"قُطِعَ"},{"ar":"مِّن","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"لِّينَةٍ","tr":"līnatin","en":"(the) palm-trees","root":"لين","lem":"لِينَة"},{"ar":"أَوْ","tr":"aw","en":"or"},{"ar":"تَرَكْتُمُوهَا","tr":"taraktumūhā","en":"you left them","root":"ترك","lem":"تَرَكَ"},{"ar":"قَآئِمَةً","tr":"qāimatan","en":"standing","root":"قوم","lem":"قائِمَة"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"on"},{"ar":"أُصُولِهَا","tr":"uṣūlihā","en":"their roots","root":"أصل","lem":"أَصْل"},{"ar":"فَبِإِذْنِ","tr":"fabi-idh'ni","en":"it (was) by the permission","root":"أذن","lem":"إِذْن"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","tr":"l-lahi","en":"(of) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَلِيُخْزِىَ","tr":"waliyukh'ziya","en":"and that He may disgrace","root":"خزي","lem":"أَخْزَيْ"},{"ar":"ٱلْفَـٰسِقِينَ","tr":"l-fāsiqīna","en":"the defiantly disobedient","root":"فسق","lem":"فاسِق"}]},{"n":6,"juz":28,"ar":"وَمَآ أَفَآءَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِهِۦ مِنْهُمْ فَمَآ أَوْجَفْتُمْ عَلَيْهِ مِنْ خَيْلٍ وَلَا رِكَابٍ وَلَـٰكِنَّ ٱللَّهَ يُسَلِّطُ رُسُلَهُۥ عَلَىٰ مَن يَشَآءُ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ كُلِّ شَىْءٍ قَدِيرٌ","en":"And what Allāh restored [of property] to His Messenger from them - you did not spur for it [in an expedition] any horses or camels, but Allāh gives His messengers power over whom He wills, and Allāh is over all things competent.","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And what"},{"ar":"أَفَآءَ","tr":"afāa","en":"(was) restored","root":"فيأ","lem":"أَفاءَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"(by) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"to"},{"ar":"رَسُولِهِۦ","tr":"rasūlihi","en":"His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","tr":"min'hum","en":"from them"},{"ar":"فَمَآ","tr":"famā","en":"then not"},{"ar":"أَوْجَفْتُمْ","tr":"awjaftum","en":"you made expedition","root":"وجف","lem":"أَوْجَفْ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِ","tr":"ʿalayhi","en":"for it"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"of"},{"ar":"خَيْلٍۢ","tr":"khaylin","en":"horses","root":"خيل","lem":"خَيْل"},{"ar":"وَلَا","tr":"walā","en":"and not"},{"ar":"رِكَابٍۢ","tr":"rikābin","en":"camels","root":"ركب","lem":"رِكاب"},{"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","tr":"walākinna","en":"but"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","tr":"l-laha","en":"Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"يُسَلِّطُ","tr":"yusalliṭu","en":"gives power","root":"سلط","lem":"سَلَّطَ"},{"ar":"رُسُلَهُۥ","tr":"rusulahu","en":"(to) His Messengers","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"over"},{"ar":"مَن","tr":"man","en":"whom"},{"ar":"يَشَآءُ ۚ","tr":"yashāu","en":"He wills","root":"شيأ","lem":"شاءَ"},{"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","tr":"wal-lahu","en":"And Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"(is) on"},{"ar":"كُلِّ","tr":"kulli","en":"every","root":"كلل","lem":"كُلّ"},{"ar":"شَىْءٍۢ","tr":"shayin","en":"thing","root":"شيأ","lem":"شَىْء"},{"ar":"قَدِيرٌۭ","tr":"qadīrun","en":"All-Powerful","root":"قدر","lem":"قَدِير"}]},{"n":7,"juz":28,"ar":"مَّآ أَفَآءَ ٱللَّهُ عَلَىٰ رَسُولِهِۦ مِنْ أَهْلِ ٱلْقُرَىٰ فَلِلَّهِ وَلِلرَّسُولِ وَلِذِى ٱلْقُرْبَىٰ وَٱلْيَتَـٰمَىٰ وَٱلْمَسَـٰكِينِ وَٱبْنِ ٱلسَّبِيلِ كَىْ لَا يَكُونَ دُولَةًۢ بَيْنَ ٱلْأَغْنِيَآءِ مِنكُمْ ۚ وَمَآ ءَاتَىٰكُمُ ٱلرَّسُولُ فَخُذُوهُ وَمَا نَهَىٰكُمْ عَنْهُ فَٱنتَهُوا۟ ۚ وَٱتَّقُوا۟ ٱللَّهَ ۖ إِنَّ ٱللَّهَ شَدِيدُ ٱلْعِقَابِ","en":"And what Allāh restored to His Messenger from the people of the towns - it is for Allāh and for the Messenger and for [his] near relatives and orphans and the needy and the [stranded] traveler - so that it will not be a perpetual distribution among the rich from among you. And whatever the Messenger has given you - take; and what he has forbidden you - refrain from. And fear Allāh; indeed, Allāh is severe in penalty.","w":[{"ar":"مَّآ","tr":"mā","en":"What"},{"ar":"أَفَآءَ","tr":"afāa","en":"(was) restored","root":"فيأ","lem":"أَفاءَ"},{"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","tr":"l-lahu","en":"(by) Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"عَلَىٰ","tr":"ʿalā","en":"to"},{"ar":"رَسُولِهِۦ","tr":"rasūlihi","en":"His Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"مِنْ","tr":"min","en":"from"},{"ar":"أَهْلِ","tr":"ahli","en":"(the) people","root":"أهل","lem":"أَهْل"},{"ar":"ٱلْقُرَىٰ","tr":"l-qurā","en":"(of) the towns","root":"قري","lem":"قَرْيَة"},{"ar":"فَلِلَّهِ","tr":"falillahi","en":"(it is) for Allah","root":"أله","lem":"اللَّه"},{"ar":"وَلِلرَّسُولِ","tr":"walilrrasūli","en":"and His Messenger","root":"رسل